<title>NIGERIA: Guinness Nigeria half-yr profit down.</title>
<headline>Guinness Nigeria half-yr profit down.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Guinness Nigeria to end-June. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				    1996	   1995</p>
<p>Turnover 4,300    vs     3,800</p>
<p>Profit before taxation    507    vs	 592.4</p>
<p>Taxation			162    vs	 219.2</p>
<p>Profit after taxation     344.8  vs	 373.2</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>Note - Guinness Nigeria is owned 60 percent by Nigerian investors and the rest by foreign interests including Guinness Overseas Limited which holds 25.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
